    "name": "Ruins of Hadvoron",
    "steam_appid": 3744440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of Hadvoron</strong> is a fast paced Third Person Action Roguelike playable by yourself or with a team made of up to 4 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Godhunters</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the 10+ available <strong>Godhunters</strong>, each one with a different passive and four unique skills.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unique Builds</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become as powerful as ever with a system of infinitely stackable bonuses thanks to the Passive Item system, create mayhem while slaying as many enemies as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 Activable Items acting like new skills for the playable characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>High Replayability</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the <strong>Guardian's</strong> statue hidden in the stages (more than 20 stages) or fullfill the required objective to fight powerful Bosses and test your skill and your build.<br><br><br>Unlock new Items that can be found in each run or find new weapons for the\u00a0<strong>Godhunters</strong>\u00a0that change the playstyle of that character, increasing the replayability of the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of Hadvoron</strong> is a fast paced Third Person Action Roguelike playable by yourself or with a team made of up to 4 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Godhunters</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the 10+ available <strong>Godhunters</strong>, each one with a different passive and four unique skills.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unique Builds</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become as powerful as ever with a system of infinitely stackable bonuses thanks to the Passive Item system, create mayhem while slaying as many enemies as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 Activable Items acting like new skills for the playable characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>High Replayability</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the <strong>Guardian's</strong> statue hidden in the stages (more than 20 stages) or fullfill the required objective to fight powerful Bosses and test your skill and your build.<br><br><br>Unlock new Items that can be found in each run or find new weapons for the\u00a0<strong>Godhunters</strong>\u00a0that change the playstyle of that character, increasing the replayability of the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Find the way through the Shattered Cities while slaying numerous enemies and looting infinitely stacking items, in this Roguelike combining fast paced third person combat system and exploration. Playable Singleplayer or up to 4 players.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
